	(text "C2 calculations\nThe purpose of C2 is to constrain the bandwidth to 18MHz\nOPA381's datasheet \ngives 2 formulas for C2:\n2. 1/(2π * Rf * (Cf + C STRAY) = \nsquare root of [ (GBW/4π* Rf * CTOT) ]\n\n2. CTOT = CDiode + 2.5 pF + 1 pF\n\nGiven values from datasheet:\n1. CTOT = 40 pF + 2.5 pF + \n1 pF = 43.5 pF\n2. C STRAY = 0.2 pF\n3. GBW of OPA381= 18MHz\n\nRf=1 000 000 ohms\n\nPlugging all of these into the above formula and isolating C2 (Cf), we get C2 = 2.7pF. "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 150.368 194.31 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
